          "note_type"
        ],
        "title": "AIVisitNote",
        "description": "This represents the note summary for a single specific note schema. A given appointment will have multiple\nAI visit notes.\n\nContents of the note are persisted for a long period of time and then eventually deleted.\n\nWe use soft deletion so we have a clear idea of when the note was deleted."
      },
